text Could it be that... I have somehow been pushing myself...?
text Have I been making an unconscious sacrifice while I am with Fujibayashi...?
text I don't know...
text ...And speaking of things that I don't know, I don't know how Kyou feels either...
text If, just like Sunohara said, Kyou actually likes me...
text ...Then why would she... try to get me together with Fujibayashi...?
text That's almost as if she wants to strangle herself...
text Is her sister really that important to her...?
