text Later, on our way back...
text ...we walk next to each other, side by side, as we chit-chat.
text We talk about how everyone was so happy about the tarot card sessions after school, and how they discussed things with her.
text About what we saw on TV yesterday, or the book she read before she went to sleep.
text It really is just meaningless chit-chat.
text Just an average scene in our daily lives.
text To me, moments like these are only natural...
